{"id":"5341a0bc9ba0e23a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modified-realizability-full-model.md","title":"全类型结构中的改良实现性","display":"df-modified-realizability-full-model — 全类型结构中的改良实现性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model","aliases":["72-df-modified-realizability-full-model"],"display":"df-modified-realizability-full-model — 全类型结构中的改良实现性","depends_on":["[[72-df-modified-realizer-type]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI Definition3.4 and §3.3(i), print430–431/PDF442–443; external full-model instance","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"typed structural recursion checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"明确本节点有序对投影采用从0起的指标约定"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modified-realizability-full-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modified-realizability-full-model — 全类型结构中的改良实现性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"604f716378c63109\" href=\"?note=604f716378c63109\" title=\"72-df-modified-realizer-type\">72-df-modified-realizer-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI Definition3.4 and §3.3(i), print430–431/PDF442–443; external full-model instance"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"typed structural recursion checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"明确本节点有序对投影采用从0起的指标约定"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rt},\\mathcal D_\\sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{rt},\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"604f716378c63109\" href=\"?note=604f716378c63109\" title=\"72-df-modified-realizer-type\">72-df-modified-realizer-type</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。项求值及环境更新取其语法上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}\">\\(\\mathsf{AT}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a>。</li>\n<li>在每个子句中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 取该左侧公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rt}\">\\(\\operatorname{rt}\\)</span> 所指定的载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0,\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_0,\\pi_1\\)</span> 为集合有序对投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MR}\">\\(\\operatorname{MR}\\)</span> 是下式按严格子公式递归的外部关系，不是 HA 内部公式。</li>\n<li>本节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0\">\\(\\pi_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span> 依次表示有序对的第一、第二投影。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MR}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal M_a}\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\times\\{A\\}\\times\\omega^\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MR}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal M_a}\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\times\\{A\\}\\times\\omega^\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,t=_a s,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\bot_a,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow0=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,A\\land_a B,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_0r,A,\\eta)\\land\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1r,B,\\eta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,A\\to_a B,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall u\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\ (\\operatorname{MR}(u,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MR}(r(u),B,\\eta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{MR}(r(m),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1r,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto\\pi_0r]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,t=_a s,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\bot_a,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow0=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,A\\land_a B,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_0r,A,\\eta)\\land\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1r,B,\\eta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,A\\to_a B,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall u\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\ (\\operatorname{MR}(u,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MR}(r(u),B,\\eta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{MR}(r(m),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1r,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto\\pi_0r]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在 Hypothesis 明确对每条递归的实现者作类型限制；因此 r(u)、r(m) 是全函数应用，投影也总在正确积载体上。与数实现性的重要区别是蕴涵实现者必须在整个输入类型上有定义，而不只是实际实现前件的输入。此处选择全类型结构进行外部语义实例化，未宣称所有这些集合函数都可由程序给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modified-realizer-type","status":"resolved","id":"604f716378c63109","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modified-realizer-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modified-realizer-type","status":"resolved","id":"604f716378c63109","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a$，$\\operatorname{rt},\\mathcal D_\\sigma$ 取 [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]]；$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$。项求值及环境更新取其语法上游；$\\mathsf{AT}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a$，$\\operatorname{rt},\\mathcal D_\\sigma$ 取 [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]]；$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$。项求值及环境更新取其语法上游；$\\mathsf{AT}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rt},\\mathcal D_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0,\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MR}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathcal M_a}\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\times\\{A\\}\\times\\omega^\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,t=_a s,\\eta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\bot_a,\\eta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow0=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,A\\land_a B,\\eta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_0r,A,\\eta)\\land\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1r,B,\\eta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,A\\to_a B,\\eta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall u\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\ (\\operatorname{MR}(u,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MR}(r(u),B,\\eta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{MR}(r(m),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MR}(r,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{MR}(\\pi_1r,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto\\pi_0r]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2838,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinato